{"title":"2023 CMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In an acute triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/1/fc17e4239110678b6306b2710627c47a850484c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle A B C, K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" /> is a point on the extension of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/4/0f48654d3431fa456308c0d1635928f1b086132a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />. Through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />, draw lines parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/0/b5092814adc11bcdc98e23eda01aac125cb98e35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/2/4529afb8e2d6b881ca34b853d00ce39784b4e756.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, denoted as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1d49e410eec4db59d6dfd2066b5409b7d01819f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/c/c4cc7810fe6acbb4d1a4eceb331e59d4b5decbaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> respectively, such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecd65c9ab4a4bd27e600189c4d84ec10561fb0b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B K=B P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/1/181d00db26eccdd48efeb3d39cd6f01991373ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C K=C Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />. Let the circumcircle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/7/217ee59e2144e5348f8259c08f28942448113cb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle K P Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" /> intersect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/1/671c460b7d227d0683b6737c033a0707cd146637.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> at point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. Prove: \n</p><p>(1) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/b/edbec003a2e12ea1f900c9148c4409728f8dceac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B T C+\\angle A P B=\\angle C Q A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"214\" height=\"18\" />; \n</p><p>(2) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/8/d8843b5e948e1029bf438904c4951a7f5e911380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A P \\cdot B T \\cdot C Q=A Q \\cdot C T \\cdot B P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"247\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Proof for (1):\nLet the side lengths of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/6/a36785e87c20166dff8ed6bf0c8bb102bd586790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle A B C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/857a5f6a60d95cc62aee13a6d65e57cb64312cb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K A=K^{\\prime} T-2 K B-K C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"207\" height=\"17\" />.\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/3/5236a07a49fdb655bb82e9ea31149c21d71e83a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B C=a, C A=b, A B=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"201\" height=\"18\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/f/66fefee251ea330dfb59050372417b9384e5f341.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle A=\\angle B=\\angle K^{\\prime} \\Rightarrow \\frac{A B}{\\sin C}=\\frac{B C}{\\sin A}=\\frac{C A}{\\sin B}\\]\" width=\"342\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/857a5f6a60d95cc62aee13a6d65e57cb64312cb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K A=K^{\\prime} T-2 K B-K C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"207\" height=\"17\" />&#160;:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/f/cef904609c1a6e9ce99e27912890062e50fbdfd2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{gathered} 2 K A \\cos (\\angle K-\\angle A-\\theta)=2 a \\cos \\theta \\\\ \\Rightarrow \\cos (\\angle \\theta)=2 a \\cos (\\angle C+\\theta) \\end{gathered}\\]\" width=\"272\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/0/da003efa57e9f760018da4fa4f8f5f5e153e4b0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K T \\sin A=K P \\sin \\theta+C \\sin (\\angle A+\\theta)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"300\" height=\"20\" />&#160;:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/0/a90f61837f89ff4cf479d3744b6d712ed37de63e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{gathered} \\Rightarrow \\angle B K C+\\angle C=\\theta, \\quad \\angle A^{\\prime}=180^{\\circ}-\\angle C^{\\prime}-(\\angle A+B)=\\angle K+A \\\\ \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\sin (\\angle A)}{\\sin (\\angle A+\\theta)}=\\frac{\\cos B}{\\cos C} \\\\ \\Rightarrow \\cos (\\angle A-B) \\leq \\cos \\theta \\Rightarrow \\cos (\\angle A-B-C) \\Rightarrow \\cos (\\angle A-B-C) \\end{gathered}\\]\" width=\"522\" height=\"94\" />\n</p><p>Assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/e/11e9b509fe177be8a91ad5f0fdafcb3f3933416a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{\\sin B}=\\frac{b}{\\sin A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a4c14806ef7b461b497a4adac472f364aecbb63.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A P: B T: C T=A B: C T: B P\\]\" width=\"252\" height=\"13\" />\nProof: (2)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a51496cb8e28ffd81d4f7af8094dcc3b191094.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{gathered} A P=A R, A P=A S, C Q=C K, B P=B K \\Rightarrow \\frac{B T}{A R} \\cdot \\frac{A R}{C T} \\cdot \\frac{C A}{B P}=1 \\Rightarrow(*) \\\\ \\frac{B T}{A R}=\\frac{\\sin \\angle B A T}{\\sin \\angle A B C}=\\frac{\\sin \\angle A T}{\\sin B} \\Rightarrow \\frac{A S}{C T}=\\frac{\\sin C}{\\sin \\theta} \\end{gathered}\\]\" width=\"581\" height=\"81\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/3/7834a5ac0d158e4e9f4eac31cadb20e30d8461b2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[CK=b \\sin \\theta \\ (\\sin (c-\\theta), BK=c \\sin (A+\\theta) / \\sin (c-\\theta)\\]\" width=\"430\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/8/13894a9903e20aeba688411f03b24a085600fe7e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(*) \\Leftrightarrow \\frac{\\sin (A+\\theta)}{\\sin B} \\cdot \\frac{\\sin c}{\\sin \\theta} \\cdot \\frac{6 \\sin \\theta}{c \\sin (A+\\theta)}=1 \\Leftrightarrow \\frac{b}{c}=\\frac{\\sin B}{\\sin C}\\]\" width=\"436\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>~xiaohuangya|szm\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA)\">2023 CMO(CHINA)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=2023\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CMO(CHINA)_Problems_and_Solutions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CMO(CHINA) Problems and Solutions\"> All CMO(CHINA) Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017163923\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 177/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1038/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 48/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6152/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.606      1 Template:CMO_box\n100.00%   10.606      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:27730:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017163923 and revision id 219684. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}